        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo ILP-212, 12\" Inswing Door Security Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your In-swing side, back and front doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis security door latch protector is 12\" high and designed for inswinging doors (the door opens into the room). Easy to install  with the included fasteners. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/6-inch-inswing-door-security-latch-guard-don-jo-ilp-206\"><b>6\" Inswing Door Security Latch Guard</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-ILP-212_size.gif?v=1704354619\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo ILP-212 Inswing Door Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe \"U\" shaped channel screws to the doors face. The protector plate screws to the door jamb.  When the door is closed the 2 plates interlock, guarding the door latch from vandalism. Non-Handed, reversible for left or right hand inswinging doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo ILP-212  Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 3 each #10 x 1-1/4\" one way screws. 3 each #8 x 1-1/4\" WS Flat Head.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ILP-212.pdf?v=1704262262\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo ILP-212 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Inswing Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo ILP-212",
                "description": "Don-Jo ILP-212 Inswing Door Latch Guards. Protect your In-swing side, back and front doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation.  This security door latch protector is 12 inch high and designed for inswinging doors (the door opens into the room). Easy to install  with the included fasteners.",
